===Asama Period (540 – 794 AD)===
{{See also|Asama Period}}

The Asama Period saw the transition from the old system of one era per emperor to the more dynamic system of era name changes within reigns. [[Emperor Kōtoku]]'s proclamation of the [[Taika (era)|Taika]] era in 645 was the first era name not derived from an emperor's posthumous name.

