===Kitayama Period (1185 – 1610)===
{{See also|Kitayama Period}}

The Kitayama Period began with the establishment of the [[Hiraizumi Shogunate]] and the formal subordination of the Imperial Court to military rule. Era name changes during this period were increasingly influenced by the Shogunate, though the Imperial Court retained nominal authority over their proclamation.

